      <data key="d1">"A charity gala is an event that benefits a local children's hospital and brings together individuals from diverse backgrounds."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0234</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LADY VICTORIA WINDSOR&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Lady Victoria Windsor is a close friend of the couple and expressed support for their union."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lady Victoria Windsor is a close friend of the couple and expresses her belief in their love and commitment."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0234</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SAME-SEX MARRIAGES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Same-sex marriages have seen a significant increase in recent years, with over 10,000 ceremonies taking place in 2022 alone."&lt;SEP&gt;"Same-sex marriages refer to the legal unions of two people of the same sex, which have seen a significant increase according to the UK Office for National Statistics."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0234</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;THE COUPLE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
